                  },
                  "displayName" : "Lewis Pringle",
                  "self" : "https://stroika.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4fe560ca-b4e1-41d1-9bdf-97b1684eda32",
                  "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "NO - new framework is called mDNS",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Support mDNS and mDNS-SD",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Add ThirdPartyCompoennt for apply opensource mdns library (contains must of the guts).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "And then write C++ framework highlevel wrapper on all that logic. NOT SURE how much I need, but probably like for UPnP:",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "text" : "Client - listens for DNDs broaadcasts, and iether STORES THEM locally, or just makes them available via callbacks",
                                    "type" : "text"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "paragraph"
                           },
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "text" : "Do for both mndns and mdns-sd (if needed seaprately???)",
                                    "type" : "text"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "paragraph"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "blockquote"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "|Server",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "be able to advertise self as mdns device (maybe not) or service (more likely)",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Also - macos has framework for this. So PROBABLY should have backend implementation that uses ThirdPartyCompoent MDNS code from apple or builtin apple frameowrk library.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "content" : [
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "attrs" : {
                                                   "href" : "https://github.com/jevinskie/mDNSResponder/tree/master/mDNSCore"
                                                },
                                                "type" : "link"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "https://github.com/jevinskie/mDNSResponder/tree/master/mDNSCore",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : "Find some package with the library I can download by reference in",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : "an optional ThirdPartyComponent, and then wrap it appropriately in a Stroika",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : "framework (probably mDNS)",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : "(best place to download orig apple code from",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "attrs" : {
                                                   "href" : "https://opensource.apple.com/source/mDNSResponder/mDNSResponder-107.1/"
                                                },
                                                "type" : "link"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "https://opensource.apple.com/source/mDNSResponder/mDNSResponder-107.1/",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "attrs" : {
                                                   "href" : "https://opensource.apple.com/tarballs/mDNSResponder/mDNSResponder-878.200.35.tar.gz"
                                                },
                                                "type" : "link"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "https://opensource.apple.com/tarballs/mDNSResponder/mDNSResponder-878.200.35.tar.gz",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : "I built the POSIX code, on linux and ran /Sandbox/mDNSNetMonitor, and it printed alot of",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : "what I want (at least dns - no dns-service stuff)",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "type" : "hardBreak"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : ")",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       }
                                    ],
                                    "type" : "paragraph"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "listItem"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "bulletList"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "The only part that looks immediately useful would be the MDNS listenrer part (and proabbly pretty easy). That would help WTF app.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
